    {
      "id": "ask",
      "type": "flow",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "Start with a simple question: what's twenty-one times two?",
        "Your code sends it to the model, with a list of tools.",
        {
          "who": "asker",
          "say": "So the model runs the calculator itself?",
          "kind": "wrong"
        },
        "The model never runs anything. It only asks.",
        "Your code runs the calculator function.",
        "Then it hands the result back to the model."
      ],
      "data": {
        "roles": {
          "input": "c1",
          "process": "c4",
          "model": "c2",
          "tool": "c5"
        },
        "nodes": [
