    {
      "id": "loop",
      "type": "cycle",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "Under the hood, it's a loop over a growing list of messages.",
        "Each round, the whole list goes to the model.",
        "When the reply asks for a tool, that request is added.",
        "Your code runs it, and appends the result as data.",
        "It repeats until a reply asks for nothing."
      ],
      "data": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "model",
            "label": "call the model",
            "sub": "whole list in"
          },
          {
            "id": "run",
            "label": "run the tool",
            "sub": "your code"
          },
          {
            "id": "append",
            "label": "append result",
            "sub": "as data"
          }
        ],
        "exit": {
          "label": "final answer",
          "from": "model",
          "edge": "no tool call"
        },
        "panel": {
          "title": "messages",
          "lines": [
